<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. A colour for the countdown sections (Countdown Timer Flip,
  Inline, Pro 1, Pro 2 and Pro 3). With custom styling on (on: true) it is the
  creator's colour, or the fallback when the colour is empty or transparent;
  with custom styling off it is always the fallback, a theme colour-scheme
  variable. shopify/assets/live-countdown.js prints the same value live.
  {% render 'countdown-live-color', on: st.enable_custom_style, color: st.card_bg, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if on -%}{%- render 'scheme-color', color: color, fallback: fallback -%}{%- else -%}{{ fallback }}{%- endif -%}
</template>